
 ttl SYSTEM EXTERNAL Entry Offsets
 pag
* Module ENTRY offsets

*** Command Entries
 org 0
X$SPRC rmb 2 Search directory for procedure
X$EREX rmb 2 Print error messsage and return
X$SEXT rmb 2 Set (error) exit address
X$EXIT rmb 2 Exit via (error) exit address
X$SBST rmb 2 Search for substring
X$KILL rmb 2 Kill external procedure
X$BYE  rmb 2 exit basic09, give up workspace
X$KALL rmb 2 kill all external procs
X$SKST rmb 2 Skip to next logical icode stmt beginning
 ifne INCLUDED&EDITOR

X$LKTK rmb 2 Lookup token in decompile table
X$RPLC rmb 2 Replace i-code
X$PBLN rmb 2 Print a bound line
X$DBUG rmb 2 Enter debug state
X$TEXP rmb 2 Trace expression address
X$TEXR rmb 2 Trace result
 ifne L2B09
X$L2EV rmb 2 Write a protocol event line
* for the overlay module l2b09ovl (PACK)
X$BPZ  rmb 2 Clear all breakpoints
X$DEFL rmb 2 Procedure list and pathname
X$OPN0 rmb 2 Open the command output path
X$CLSC rmb 2 Close it again
X$UNBD rmb 2 Unbind a procedure
X$NXVR rmb 2 Next variable reference in I-code
* (the banner)
X$NWLN rmb 2 Reset the I/O buffer
X$STEL rmb 2 Put a string in it and print it
 endc
 endc

*** Compiler Entries
 org 0
X$CPRM rmb 2 Compile parameter list
X$NAME rmb 2 Look for a name subroutine
X$SRCH rmb 2 Table search subroutine
X$MVDN rmb 2 Block move down subroutine
 ifne INCLUDED&EDITOR

X$EXDS rmb 2 Expand desr tbl
X$CMPL rmb 2 Line compiler
 endc

*** Binder Entries
 org 0
X$BPRM rmb 2 Bind parameters
 ifne INCLUDED&EDITOR

X$BIND rmb 2 Bind procedure
X$BSTM rmb 2 Bind statement
X$PHEX rmb 2 Print hex number
 endc

*** Statement Interpreter Entries
 org 0
X$INTI rmb 2 Initialize interpreter
X$INTX rmb 2 Execute interpreter
X$IPRM rmb 2 Interpret parameters
X$STER rmb 2 Statement error exit
X$ISTM rmb 2 Interpret single statement
X$TRON rmb 2 Turn on trace mode
X$TROF rmb 2 Turn off trace mode
 ifne L2B09
X$L2RS rmb 2 Resolve procedure ptr (map banked procedure)
X$L2MW rmb 2 Map far block into the code window
X$FALL rmb 2 Free all far arrays
X$NEAR rmb 2 Refuse a far element
 endc

*** Expression Interpreter Entries
 org 0
X$EXPI rmb 2 Initialize expression
X$VREF rmb 2 Evaluate variable reference
X$FADD rmb 2 Real add
X$FMUL rmb 2 Real mult
X$FDIV rmb 2 Real divide
X$FCMP rmb 2 Real compare
X$FIX rmb 2 Fix real
X$FLOT rmb 2 Float integer
 ifne L2B09
X$FMAP rmb 2 Map far block into the data window
 endc

*** Conversion & I/O Entries
 org 0
X$ASNM rmb 2 Cnv ascii > numeric
X$CVIO rmb 2 Call cnvio


